anese dialogue<br></li><li>Enhanced with character sprite animations<br></li><li>Gallery and Scene selections</li></ul><br><br>** PLEASE NOTE **<br>All of the sexy content is now included automatically in the game download.<br><br>All characters described and visually represented in this game are over 18 years of age, and no actual, nor identifiable minor was used in the production of this game.",
